{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1329991-building-a-lunar-clash-fighter","id":1329991,"title":"Building a Lunar Clash-fighter","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-08T16:43:08-07:00","id":1329991,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Building a Lunar Clash-fighter","content":"Hey all!<br /> <br /> I'm working on a project to build up a Lunar PC. I was thinking I'd have him leverage Clashing as a favored maneuver. In part, because nobody in my group really is yet. In part, the ringing of steel parrying steel - or claw sweeping steel aside - seems like a fun theme to riff on. I was also thinking of a very Aikido / Jujutsu type of feel - where an attacker who's fencing for position with a flurry of Withering attacks might be met and parried, but someone going all out has their energy used against them, finding themselves suddenly tail-over-teakettle, flying through the air, and pinned.<br /> <br /> <b>[Magpie Borrows Homework Approach]</b><br /> <br /> Out of curiosity while I'm shopping for Charms and MArts, how would y'all go about assembling such a beast? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-08T16:45:31-07:00","id":1329992,"title":"","content":"Maybe a mongoose lunar that\u2019s one of nature\u2019s counter attack fighters<br /> I recommend getting inspiration from <a href=\"https://www.shengchifoundation.org/kungfu/mongoose\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.shengchifoundation.org/kungfu/mongoose</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12796,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12796-beast-of-bitter-oblivion","user":"Beast of Bitter Oblivion","date":". 08-08-2019, 07:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12796-beast-of-bitter-oblivion","name":"Beast of Bitter Oblivion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12796_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T04:52:08-07:00","id":1330052,"title":"","content":"*looks both ways*<br /> <br /> Crane Style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T07:02:17-07:00","id":1330061,"title":"","content":"You would probably be interested in my break downs on clashing, clashing with two-handed hammers, and clashing with various Martial Arts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1243700-how-often-do-you-delay-your-action-to-attempt-a-clash\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1243700-how-often-do-you-delay-your-action-to-attempt-a-clash\"> How often do you delay your action to attempt a clash? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1243700-how-often-do-you-delay-your-action-to-attempt-a-clash\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1243700-how-often-do-you-delay-your-action-to-attempt-a-clash </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This question is especially for players whose characters use two-handed heavy weapons, with their clash bonus and low Accuracy. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T09:52:56-07:00","id":1330071,"title":"","content":"So really, what you want in a Clash is high accuracy, and you want this accuracy cheaply so you can clash all the time.<br /> <br /> So the unfortunate thing with a bunch of Lunar builds is that they do nothing for accuracy, just damage or soak.<br /> <br /> Except for, ta dah, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1293395-ex-3-lunars-glorious-argent-beastiary-a-lunar-s-character-thread?p=1323681#post1323681\">Death Kitty</a>, which gives +3 resting accuracy more than any base Lunar build, charms and whatnot being equal, (Just ask JohnDoe, he fought one in simulation).<br /> <br /> Edit: I'm missing something but do heavy weapons help with Clash?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 08-09-2019, 01:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T10:04:44-07:00","id":1330073,"title":"","content":"Two-handed weapons get +2 accuracy in clash. This makes them as accurate as medium weapons, but with better damage.<br /> <br /> A pair of light weapons still has the best accuracy for clashes though. (Still, I've frequently found that I hit people with light weapons and then do hardly any damage, hitting people with a massive tetsubo is attractive... but then, you can make up for that with Strength charms I guess.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T10:07:32-07:00","id":1330075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1329991-building-a-lunar-clash-fighter?p=1330073#post1330073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Two-handed weapons get +2 accuracy in clash. This makes them as accurate as medium weapons, but with better damage.<br /> <br /> A pair of light weapons still has the best accuracy for clashes though. (Still, I've frequently found that I hit people with light weapons and then do hardly any damage, hitting people with a massive tetsubo is attractive... but then, you can make up for that with Strength charms I guess.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, cool. Yeah, so Light Weapons and you pray that you win the clash. With 21 resting accuracy (no motes spent at all), Death Kitty has a pretty good shot.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T10:37:40-07:00","id":1330079,"title":"","content":"With 2 short daiklaives, Dex 5, Melee 5 and a specialty, you've got, what... 18 dice before charms? Doesn't require much praying.<br /> <br /> How does death kitty have such high accuracy? Doesn't it run into dice caps? Or is this with a stunt?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T10:39:42-07:00","id":1330080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1329991-building-a-lunar-clash-fighter?p=1330079#post1330079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With 2 short daiklaives, Dex 5, Melee 5 and a specialty, you've got, what... 18 dice before charms? Doesn't require much praying.<br /> <br /> How does death kitty have such high accuracy? Doesn't it run into dice caps? Or is this with a stunt?</div> </div> </div> </div>Cats have a +3 inherent accuracy buff if you buy one of their latents. (Counts as charm dice, but its basically free once you've shapechanged) So you can do everything someone with the two short daiklaives can do and then add +3 on to that.<br /> <br /> prototype00","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T11:11:00-07:00","id":1330089,"title":"","content":"Yeah, but short daiklaives have +5 non-charm accuracy, +7 when clashing.<br /> <br /> Surely that's better than an cat's +1 non-charm accuracy. Dex 5, Brawl 5, +1 spec maybe, +1 accuracy, +3 from this latent, is 14. With a stunt, 16, and up to 7 more charm dice, that's 24, is it not?<br /> But you're the expert on cat mechanics, I'm not as familiar with them.<br /> <br /> Whereas Dex 5, Melee 5, +1 spec, +5 non-charm accuracy for a daiklaive, +2 non-charm accuracy from two weapons in a clash, is 18 dice, plus a stunt is 20, and then you can potentially buy 10 dice which is 30 dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T11:12:56-07:00","id":1330090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1329991-building-a-lunar-clash-fighter?p=1330089#post1330089\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, but short daiklaives have +5 non-charm accuracy, +7 when clashing.<br /> <br /> Surely that's better than an cat's +1 non-charm accuracy. Dex 5, Brawl 5, +1 spec maybe, +1 accuracy, +3 from this latent, is 14. With a stunt, 16, and up to 7 more charm dice, that's 24, is it not?<br /> <br /> Whereas Dex 5, Melee 5, +1 spec, +5 non-charm accuracy for a daiklaive, +2 non-charm accuracy from two weapons in a clash, is 18 dice, plus a stunt is 20, and then you can potentially buy 10 dice which is 30 dice.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can either Last Warrior's Unity Artifact Light Weapons onto the cat or use Wood Dragon's Claw which gives you paired Tigers Claw (are wood dragon claws considered paired light weapons?). So like I said, it's the Exalt with the artifact weapons + Cat's inherent +3 Charm bonus to attack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 08-09-2019, 02:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T11:15:22-07:00","id":1330093,"title":"","content":"Ah, I see, yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T15:20:04-07:00","id":1330144,"title":"","content":"ooo, go off to work and come back to some tantalizing answers to uptake!<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks gang!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T16:29:49-07:00","id":1330164,"title":"","content":"I'm spacing out on where paired weapons (ie, identical claws, short daiklaves) give a Clash bonus. I know I saw it somewhere, haha! Do they just pick up the &quot;two handed&quot; tag in that case?<br /> <br /> How is Death Kitty bringing in Ambush Hunter while having a Wood Dragon's Claw? Can she have the Claw going while a kitty (now that's a Lunar-grade idea to imagine!) or is she able to Ambush Hunt while in a human shape?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T17:20:29-07:00","id":1330173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1329991-building-a-lunar-clash-fighter?p=1330052#post1330052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*looks both ways*<br /> <br /> Crane Style.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd disregarded Crane as being defense rather than Clash, per se... but now that I'm reading through, the idea of defending hard and counterattacking is very much in theme! Thanks JD!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T18:07:11-07:00","id":1330178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Simon Darkstep</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1329991-building-a-lunar-clash-fighter?p=1330164#post1330164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm spacing out on where paired weapons (ie, identical claws, short daiklaves) give a Clash bonus. I know I saw it somewhere, haha! Do they just pick up the &quot;two handed&quot; tag in that case?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Characters who dual-wield two identical weapons gain a +2 bonus to Clash attacks. \u201cUnarmed\u201d is considered a single weapon. </div> </div> </div> Ex3 Core Pg 586.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How is Death Kitty bringing in Ambush Hunter while having a Wood Dragon's Claw? Can she have the Claw going while a kitty (now that's a Lunar-grade idea to imagine!) or is she able to Ambush Hunt while in a human shape? </div> </div> </div>You can use Wood Dragon's Claw while in Animal shape (confirmed in Ask the Devs), and it uses the normal calculation of Dex + Brawl+ Accuracy to hit and Str + 10 + threshold for damage. So she uses it as a Tiny Kitty Cat.<br /> <br /> If Sorcery isn't your thing, you can Last Warrior's Unity (Strength Charm) instead for much the same effect with Artifact Razor Claws.<br /> <br /> Oh, and just realized in Clash she actually rolls 23 dice (since paired light weapons and all) pre-charms.<br /> <br /> prototype00","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 08-09-2019, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-10T01:09:33-07:00","id":1330220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Simon Darkstep</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1329991-building-a-lunar-clash-fighter?p=1330164#post1330164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm spacing out on where paired weapons (ie, identical claws, short daiklaves) give a Clash bonus. I know I saw it somewhere, haha! Do they just pick up the &amp;quot;two handed&amp;quot; tag in that case?</div> </div> </div> </div>Page 568: Dual Wielding","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-10T13:47:01-07:00","id":1330294,"title":"","content":"Give yourselves an XP, thanks all! <br /> <br /> *off to crunch some numbers!<br /> <br /> Also - tiny kitty with wood dragon claw.... splendid!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-nam